<title>USA: Parallel Petroleum registers common.</title>
<headline>Parallel Petroleum registers common.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parallel Petroleum Corp said Thursday it filed a registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission relating to the proposed sale of 2.5 million common shares, plus 375,000 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>All of the shares will be offered by the company through underwriters led by Van Kasper &amp; Co, Parallel said.</p>
<p>The company's statement did not say what it planned to do with the proceeds.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
